# OBDient environment variables — template
# Copy to .env and fill in your own values.  (.env is gitignored)
#
# AI inference: the local assistant runs 100% ON-DEVICE via the QVAC SDK
# (@qvac/sdk) — no server, no base URL, no model env var (model selected in code
# at src/data/datasources/qvac-sdk.datasource.ts).

# VIN decoding uses the keyless NHTSA vPIC API (src/data/datasources/nhtsa.datasource.ts).
# No API key is needed or embedded.

# Senior assistant ("Assistente Sr") — the cloud escalation.
# The app talks ONLY to the OBDient senior proxy (obdient-seed/src/proxy); the
# provider API key lives SERVER-SIDE on the proxy host, never in the app.
#
# Only the proxy URL is needed here. A URL is not a secret, so EXPO_PUBLIC_ is
# correct — Metro inlines it into the bundle at build time (access via static
# dot notation: process.env.EXPO_PUBLIC_SENIOR_PROXY_URL).
#
# ⚠️ NEVER put a provider API key (NVIDIA/Anthropic/…) in this file. Any
# EXPO_PUBLIC_* value is inlined into the public JS bundle and extractable from
# the APK (audit C1). Provider keys belong only in the proxy's environment.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SENIOR_PROXY_URL=https://your-proxy-host.example.com
